# AI Guidance Language

Persistent AI guidance in this repository must be written in English.

This applies to:

- Cursor rules under `.cursor/rules/`
- Cursor skills under `.cursor/skills/`
- Other project-level AI guidance files, if added later

When editing or creating these files:

- Use English for titles, descriptions, instructions, examples, and templates.
- Preserve existing technical identifiers, log messages, file paths, code symbols, and command output exactly as needed.
- If user-facing product text or source data is intentionally non-English, keep it unchanged and explain that exception in English.
